OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan's plea to reinstate A&E after
OL,4,Amother's fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who spent hours in A&E with his
OL,7,Felderly mother after she had a fall has
OL,8,Fspoken about the need to reopen an
OL,9,Femergency department at the hospital in
OL,10,FCanterbury.
OL,12,FAndrew Minter, from Ash, took his
OL,13,Fmother to the urgent treatment centre
OL,14,Fat the city's Kent & Canterbury
OL,15,FHospital (KCH) after she fell last
OL,16,Fyear, before they were sent to A&E in
OL,17,FAshford, where they spent more than
OL,18,Feight hours.
OL,20,FHe is backing calls by a group of
OL,21,Fretired NHS workers for the hospital to
OL,22,Fhave an A&E.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
