OL,3,GNEWSAMan's plea to reinstate A&E after
OL,4,Amother's fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Mackie, acting chief medical
OL,7,Fofficer at East Kent Hospitals NHS said
OL,8,Fthe trust wanted to transform urgent
OL,9,Fand emergency care, and care for
OL,10,Felderly and vulnerable patients, over
OL,11,Fthe next five years.
